import InfoGeometry.Algebra.Zorn.G2GAPFlagWitnessData

/-!
# Compatibility names for G₂ flag-cell witness data

The historical `G2FlagCellWitnessCertificate` data file was removed during the
G₂ provenance cleanup.  A live theorem owner,
`G2Fin189OrbitMembershipCertificate`, still consumes the historical names
`leftWitness` and `rightWitness`.

The authoritative data now lives in `G2GAPFlagWitnessData`, generated by the
current GAP export pipeline.  This module contains no independent witness table
and proves no CAS statement: it is a transparent compatibility surface mapping
the old names to the current data owner.
-/

namespace InfoGeometry.Algebra.Zorn.G2FlagCellWitnessCertificate

open InfoGeometry.Algebra.Zorn.G2GAPFlagWitnessData

/-- Historical name for the current GAP-exported left witness table. -/
abbrev leftWitness := gapLeftWitness

/-- Historical name for the current GAP-exported right witness table. -/
abbrev rightWitness := gapRightWitness

end InfoGeometry.Algebra.Zorn.G2FlagCellWitnessCertificate
